      "name": null,
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(P∧Q)∨(R∧Q)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we can factor out the conjunction with $Q,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(P∧Q)∨(R∧Q)≡(P∨R)∧Q\n$$\n\nThen, we can write\n\n$$\n(P∨R)∧Q≡Q∧(P∨R).\n$$",
